| Mozilla Rhino — `org.mozilla:rhino` | MPL-2.0 |
| AndroidX (appcompat, activity, constraintlayout, recyclerview, multidex, webkit) | Apache-2.0 |
| Google Material Components — `com.google.android.material:material` | Apache-2.0 |
| Google Gson — `com.google.code.gson:gson` | Apache-2.0 |
